# The dock is the 24-cell, DERIVED in the kernel. A tone written in four slots, each in {-1,0,+1}, gives 3^4 = 81 words.
# Sort them by how many slots are nonzero: the shells have sizes choose(4,k) * 2^k for k = 0..4, namely 1, 8, 24, 32, 16,
# and they sum to 81 = 3^4 (the binomial expansion of (1+2)^4). The two-nonzero shell, choose(4,2) * 2^2 = 6 * 4 = 24, is
# the 24-cell: choose which two of four slots are nonzero (6 ways), a sign for each (4 ways). Everything here is checked by
# definitional computation on a LOCAL inductive natural (cross-file casing on an imported inductive type is unsupported).
# The binomial coefficient is pinned at the whole Pascal row 1,4,6,4,1 and at a second instance choose(5,2)=10, and the
# shell decomposition is the real content: it cannot sum to 81 by accident.

# A natural number.
form natural
  case zero
  case succ
    link prior, like natural

# Addition by recursion on the first argument.
task plus
  take a, like natural
  take b, like natural
  like natural
  fork case, read a
    case zero
      send back
        read b
    case succ
      send back
        make succ
          bind prior
            call plus
              read prior
              read b

# Multiplication by repeated addition.
task times
  take a, like natural
  take b, like natural
  like natural
  fork case, read a
    case zero
      send back
        make zero
    case succ
      send back
        call plus
          read b
          call times
            read prior
            read b

# Exponentiation: power b e = b multiplied e times. Counts the 2^k sign choices, and gives 3^4 = 81.
task power
  take b, like natural
  take e, like natural
  like natural
  fork case, read e
    case zero
      send back
        make succ
          bind prior
            make zero
    case succ
      send back
        call times
          read b
          call power
            read b
            read prior


rule probe-times
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call times
        make succ
          bind prior
            make succ
              bind prior
                make succ
                  bind prior
                    make zero
        make succ
          bind prior
            make succ
              bind prior
                make zero
      make succ
        bind prior
          make succ
            bind prior
              make succ
                bind prior
                  make succ
                    bind prior
                      make succ
                        bind prior
                          make succ
                            bind prior
                              make zero
  calm

rule probe-power
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call power
        make succ
          bind prior
            make succ
              bind prior
                make zero
        make succ
          bind prior
            make succ
              bind prior
                make zero
      make succ
        bind prior
          make succ
            bind prior
              make succ
                bind prior
                  make succ
                    bind prior
                      make zero
  calm
